Mr. White- Good Morning.  It's a beautiful day here in Waldport and I hope =
the sun is shining at Siltcoos as well.

I had the opportunity to talk with Patrol Officer Felicia Sloan this mornin=
g about the incident you describe in your e-mail.  Unfortunately, the only =
information I have relates to the Forest Service and you seem to already ha=
ve that information- Patrol Officer Felicia Sloan and Special Agent Matt Ol=
iver.

The other two officers were with Oregon State Police. The Oregon State Poli=
ce website has contact information and it should help you find a contact th=
